{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4cc735e1beaa9eb2470ccc7b0180f76b8f793985cb8c4ac7c3c506e18188aad0049092946f1c21c6b4bc2690a375742e2135593e9593eff99f497d595b0ecf56b5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/55f96e8087c673c86f45c8a81c85e0fa70d10b08b53576ed718d024fb7dbe0cece4cf014e0e8955b15abd842eac421b3944cbf88b0a9596dfc3c629d42d8879bc464def0472cca5efc81c5af8714af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9be2953c5137b902eb9cd9b9f182c0b6aff171f8eef201f81c2f830e8a402d1c2f9849faa413854983fc39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a7d93583af1e3fe833670e449b46ca70f205e386fe9f7b285b70a6b7a9989918d23b432bd86c80d62ed518e55e4744bb9d0c35a82a82cd9f2b8c98ac88a329fdf24526cb187c5cc8b9cf8fb4664476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b35c21031985567a0134954ecbfc640df31196b492abbb45f98bd5bc3ae5a39095274a6a5e9a8f9f755b200212670e960801779d67105e0c746eb4e00f41854dd91f773c71f1280fdd8946f106d704\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a65b34de527311dfc7c2f9be3eb5a4108bb5eebb16c3af3a7d6bcee710726043955bf995ea8c82fa0238fa377b38eb787300e973658861a8829cd9a09bf9164ed41382fa2539ff047d1c6103eb3afa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/44161d43e7a68a2eac7204f753a7b1ccc6c970d29f75650bebc0c2bd8f819654e822e0658503ba2139456bff3969eace8ba931d46824ff91450baf542c2ec6b3aabe20c7f118668bd2c3d058c2fdbd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2db69794cf8330d10451372b82e4b215f3a57bb1c50aa042c0bc639a97b7d3d1c3f337be263e38f612b0fc0712b58e36a1aed83d31910f47ec685130da5728a34c76158388e496271e50e77d83a2b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8a2b94a06610e7750ce1b2baf3c05b5e5bebf9619a0de1e607e8f4493ce5ba52893603ba9df1f11f5f4b69c81a0b1b5f4ef1ed9942e1860324d2ef9b1ed8c88a7f976f215e15d30329c1ffb12bae5b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/83b75148ff8e66bf556e32ef2b7ae25897935e7acb8d5480df09aa37351ec166a82bf806a809cc038498acb3b0e16bb60a99ea1d640c3823de9a40961dc556d2dda48ece825f87e22b1d0499d58e10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6e7f531b13b49fd77126693b6adb8f49ccc74bcc023b02853d1d40085cc51b6d1e9efd99a96127d392f9f754bb42f3c3f1c900975b8126722e275769c541a8205a4058fbeca63e3b527f355cafcca9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fae505adf3baf9e96c45187917523e4132ebea63d7892a05a59cadaad8eecaac52cc5694576824b3cabeb452f3e6da260d795f66ca41f9bbf4313b0bf1c114f43c6f2f41297d46ccf2ac5649d9be23\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/789b553927a93be46696d08c3e37ad5bc6abcf87477bd297494c40d5b915b04663b200cc223f505ba803b29e68fdc3fd0cf204098186cc7f958c07eab235c86985039aae7f987fce2e7e3976bbedd2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8184124bf56d89d5f3b2eabad5d7cb49ae8a4284259d624d08772d09d17618a14f43d0e5273c5854219c3faf37baf7ab71230d3986083ef7a44f4bc12321d67cd78dcb9c6fd84bbb9103f60f459c08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c0a9093fe58f5a4dd69f2c1a646445b2325bb895071acbd28acbc65aa9ad5db574e7540fdc7a815d0d305dca608a087b8eedeb2ee5593dc9bd589638bde90d544a39c386ade25899bbbeacefef519a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f07b119355674d4da3a7b76cbcd2575ea93f70e0bb6a037354c56113563fd2dcaa5c7f36e18a3cd5b5eb3395d13c5f38d20dbaa7b728701063908950cf90dd0888efa740ef70ed467c390b0e05e2ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bec3a2d1c38cec42959d094f717693ca80a1f35362514b99b5a0486bea7988b89d9dc738543a5d86a4d03522218a4a46a7e727f444ed13fd20ac8066ca1f30ecadc618ad6f6bb1f612ae39283c7152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5e00d71962f6044853d85ef00a84c4f0d40dcc066c4f50a7df5177f54505f2e814e4de40b7521117e12e3ce90302af93d7bdf8af48eb841676ded70564fc41f754fbe2f5b24a55ef33453ca19160ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cfa9cc9bbfa11f766366ce7b1175e903938aa60abeb9887c9f14b7f7828169a9e864045bca43907a7e0769331dae6de1ee845c8df90b84ddb02ead4121a62bc67b803024fc9575993462e10c287b22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2ca606e4e810637f66a3a425b25273616b665f8ba91fb65509e0ea22e8bd81508b6f3daf39f74cc5cfd46d3515941d455548d745fde240467a92960420e3d7e59dcbdf61f1817e14843d733d4e7e65\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
